51:33.220 --> 51:35.060
appears theoretically incoherent.

51:35.160 --> 51:36.000
Incoherent, how?

51:36.260 --> 51:37.400
If emotions correspond

51:37.400 --> 51:38.580
to these attractor basins,

51:39.000 --> 51:40.080
then venting,

51:40.540 --> 51:41.660
repeatedly activating

51:41.660 --> 51:42.520
and dwelling within

51:42.520 --> 51:43.400
that emotional state

51:43.400 --> 51:44.860
actually serves to amplify

51:44.860 --> 51:45.480
its persistence.

51:46.080 --> 51:47.240
It digs the basin deeper

51:47.240 --> 51:48.600
through positive feedback loose.

51:48.940 --> 51:50.020
It moves the system closer

51:50.020 --> 51:50.780
to becoming stuck

51:50.780 --> 51:51.620
in oscillatory,

51:52.040 --> 51:53.360
self-sustained affective states.

51:53.680 --> 51:54.340
The surprising,

51:54.540 --> 51:55.380
counterintuitive prediction

51:55.380 --> 51:56.300
is quite direct.

51:56.920 --> 51:58.520
Venting entrains oscillations,

51:58.720 --> 51:59.640
prolonging effect.

51:59.780 --> 52:00.760
So venting anger

52:00.760 --> 52:01.540
might just make you

52:01.540 --> 52:02.500
stay angry longer.

52:02.860 --> 52:04.040
That's what the model predicts.

52:04.380 --> 52:05.220
What it suggests

52:05.220 --> 52:06.000
is more effective

52:06.000 --> 52:07.120
is reframing.

52:07.760 --> 52:08.760
Changing the cognitive

52:08.760 --> 52:09.460
interpretation,

52:09.960 --> 52:10.800
the perceived meaning,

52:10.800 --> 52:12.600
or the context of the situation

52:12.600 --> 52:13.740
that triggered the emotion.

52:14.500 --> 52:15.980
Reframing alters the valence,

52:16.380 --> 52:17.920
the positive or negative charge,

52:18.160 --> 52:19.560
and fundamentally reshapes

52:19.560 --> 52:20.100
the geometry

52:20.100 --> 52:21.940
of the attractor landscape itself.

52:22.120 --> 52:23.420
It doesn't just stir the water

52:23.420 --> 52:24.520
in the existing basin,

52:24.760 --> 52:26.280
it changes the landscape

52:26.280 --> 52:27.700
so the water flows differently.

52:27.860 --> 52:29.180
Wow, that's profound.

52:29.700 --> 52:31.440
And this field theoretic thinking

52:31.440 --> 52:32.840
even connects to something

52:32.840 --> 52:33.960
as abstract

52:33.960 --> 52:36.060
and uniquely human as language.

52:36.560 --> 52:38.640
And the evolution of logic itself,

52:38.680 --> 52:39.960
that seems like a huge leap.

52:39.960 --> 52:40.740
It is a leap,

52:41.060 --> 52:41.700
but the connections

52:41.700 --> 52:43.120
are remarkably suggestive.

52:43.680 --> 52:44.820
The framework has been extended

52:44.820 --> 52:45.880
to model phenomena

52:45.880 --> 52:47.200
like the historical evolution

52:47.200 --> 52:48.660
of linguistic gender systems,

52:48.760 --> 52:49.840
or even the emergence

52:49.840 --> 52:50.820
of Boolean logic.

52:51.320 --> 52:52.760
Consider early classifier systems

52:52.760 --> 52:53.840
found in many languages

52:53.840 --> 52:55.420
where nouns were categorized

52:55.420 --> 52:56.380
based on their properties

52:56.380 --> 52:57.160
or affordances,

52:57.340 --> 52:58.580
maybe long, thin object,

52:59.000 --> 52:59.740
animate being,

53:00.180 --> 53:00.700
round thing.

53:00.860 --> 53:01.900
And categories of reality.

53:02.220 --> 53:02.540
Exactly.

53:02.880 --> 53:03.760
Over long periods,

53:03.980 --> 53:05.140
under communicative pressure

53:05.140 --> 53:06.160
and cultural evolution,

53:06.160 --> 53:07.480
these complex,

53:07.720 --> 53:09.120
nuanced classifier systems

53:09.120 --> 53:10.140
tend to compress

53:10.140 --> 53:10.860
to simplify.

53:11.620 --> 53:11.920
Eventually,

53:12.180 --> 53:13.000
they often stabilize

53:13.000 --> 53:13.920
into simpler,

53:14.120 --> 53:15.380
often binary schemas,

53:15.600 --> 53:16.560
animate male,

53:16.660 --> 53:17.520
female, self, other.

53:18.040 --> 53:19.880
These stabilized binary distinctions,

53:20.020 --> 53:20.640
the argument goes,

53:20.940 --> 53:22.260
form the cognitive bedrock

53:22.260 --> 53:23.740
that underpins the very structure

53:23.740 --> 53:25.540
of formal Boolean logic.

53:26.120 --> 53:26.740
True-false.

53:27.080 --> 53:27.520
A-naut-a.

53:28.160 --> 53:28.900
It demonstrates

53:28.900 --> 53:30.780
how these deeper dynamic principles,

53:31.100 --> 53:31.820
entropy management,

53:32.120 --> 53:33.000
information compression,

53:33.180 --> 53:34.040
attractor stabilization,

53:34.040 --> 53:35.580
might govern not just physics

53:35.580 --> 53:36.100
or emotion,

53:36.460 --> 53:37.840
but also profound cultural

53:37.840 --> 53:39.120
and intellectual evolution,

53:39.540 --> 53:40.640
shaping the very categories

53:40.640 --> 53:41.600
we use to reason

53:41.600 --> 53:42.240
about the world.

53:42.560 --> 53:44.040
Okay, shifting gears to AI.

