We hear so much about AI,

53:45.640 --> 53:46.900
especially large language models,

53:47.040 --> 53:47.500
LLMs,

53:47.640 --> 53:48.380
raising the ceiling

53:48.380 --> 53:49.420
of human capability,

53:49.600 --> 53:50.380
pushing the frontiers

53:50.380 --> 53:50.940
of intelligence.

