54:05.960 --> 54:07.860
They process truly vast amounts

54:07.860 --> 54:08.540
of human text

54:08.540 --> 54:09.440
and learn to generate

54:09.440 --> 54:10.440
statistically probable,

54:10.960 --> 54:11.800
often quite generic,

54:12.220 --> 54:12.940
continuations.

54:13.360 --> 54:14.180
For a novice,

54:14.260 --> 54:14.940
someone starting with

54:14.940 --> 54:16.020
zero knowledge or skill

54:16.020 --> 54:16.580
in an area,

54:17.160 --> 54:18.000
getting a passable,

54:18.160 --> 54:19.400
coherent baseline draft

54:19.400 --> 54:20.180
from an LLM

54:20.180 --> 54:21.580
can be absolutely transformative.

54:21.960 --> 54:22.500
In that sense,

54:22.560 --> 54:23.420
