58:17.520 --> 58:19.120
And geometry preservation,

58:19.560 --> 58:20.220
the relationships

58:20.220 --> 58:21.000
between concepts

58:21.000 --> 58:21.700
should be maintained

58:21.700 --> 58:22.580
across translations.

58:23.320 --> 58:24.380
There's also a significant

58:24.380 --> 58:25.380
security implication.

58:26.480 --> 58:27.140
If embeddings

58:27.140 --> 58:27.880
from a sensitive

58:27.880 --> 58:28.960
proprietary model

58:28.960 --> 58:29.820
were ever to leak,

58:30.380 --> 58:31.520
VEC2VEC could potentially

58:31.520 --> 58:32.420
map that sensitive

58:32.420 --> 58:33.200
semantic content

58:33.200 --> 58:34.020
into a known

58:34.020 --> 58:35.640
open model space,

58:35.900 --> 58:36.640
making the original

58:36.640 --> 58:37.760
meaning recoverable.

58:38.140 --> 58:39.260
This platonic

58:39.260 --> 58:40.480
representation hypothesis

58:40.480 --> 58:41.880
has truly profound

58:41.880 --> 58:42.680
implications for how

58:42.680 --> 58:43.240
we think about

58:43.240 --> 58:44.180
store, manage,

58:44.280 --> 58:45.080
and secure semantic

58:45.080 --> 58:46.120
information in the future.

58:46.340 --> 58:47.060
The scope here

58:47.060 --> 58:47.860
is just incredible.

58:48.000 --> 58:48.500
And your sources

58:48.500 --> 58:49.720
show how RSVP

58:49.720 --> 58:50.900
even integrates deeply

58:50.900 --> 58:51.680
with actual

58:51.680 --> 58:52.740
philosophical ideas.

58:52.860 --> 58:53.180
You mentioned

58:53.180 --> 58:53.980
Lawrence Cahoon's

58:53.980 --> 58:55.060
concept of a local

58:55.060 --> 58:55.640
metaphysics.

58:55.940 --> 58:56.620
How does that fit in?

58:56.820 --> 58:57.480
It helps ground

58:57.480 --> 58:58.360
these very abstract

58:58.360 --> 58:59.140
field ideas.

58:59.520 --> 59:00.280
Cahoon's philosophy,

59:00.660 --> 59:01.200
sometimes called

59:01.200 --> 59:02.220
objective relativism

59:02.220 --> 59:03.460
or pluralistic realism,

59:04.180 --> 59:05.180
argues compellingly

59:05.180 --> 59:05.780
that no entity

59:05.780 --> 59:06.740
exists in isolation.

59:07.720 --> 59:08.680
Every complex thing

59:08.680 --> 59:09.240
from a particle

59:09.240 --> 59:09.820
to a person

59:09.820 --> 59:10.460
to a society

59:10.460 --> 59:11.940
is fundamentally defined

59:11.940 --> 59:12.580
by its relations

59:12.580 --> 59:13.520
to other complexes.

59:14.260 --> 59:15.500
Reality is relational.

59:16.120 --> 59:17.160
RSVP provides

59:17.160 --> 59:17.620
a potential

59:17.620 --> 59:18.960
mathematical formalization

59:18.960 --> 59:19.360
for this.

59:20.060 --> 59:20.660
Each entity

59:20.660 --> 59:21.300
at some level

59:21.300 --> 59:21.840
of description

59:21.840 --> 59:22.720
can be characterized

59:22.720 --> 59:24.740
by its local RSVP state,

59:24.900 --> 59:26.520
its EriVS triple.

59:27.260 --> 59:28.160
And its properties,

59:28.320 --> 59:29.080
its very nature,

59:29.380 --> 59:29.820
are functions

59:29.820 --> 59:30.920
of its dynamic relations,

59:31.040 --> 59:32.000
its field interactions

59:32.000 --> 59:33.520
with other such complexes.

59:34.080 --> 59:35.120
So the reality

59:35.120 --> 59:35.580
of an entity

59:35.580 --> 59:36.700
isn't purely intrinsic,

59:37.060 --> 59:37.720
is given by its

59:37.720 --> 59:38.880
entropic and vectorial

59:38.880 --> 59:39.840
embedding within the plenum.

59:40.380 --> 59:41.280
Objective relativism

59:41.280 --> 59:41.860
becomes almost

59:41.860 --> 59:42.700
a structural property

59:42.700 --> 59:44.140
of the RSVP fields themselves.

59:44.800 --> 59:45.920
Reality is this network

59:45.920 --> 59:47.060
of interacting processes.

59:47.580 --> 59:48.180
And Cahoon talks

59:48.180 --> 59:48.980
about different orders

59:48.980 --> 59:49.500
of nature.

59:49.940 --> 59:50.240
Yes.

59:50.660 --> 59:51.920
He identifies five

59:51.920 --> 59:53.320
broad natural orders.

59:54.080 --> 59:54.540
The physical,

59:54.840 --> 59:55.300
the material,

59:55.540 --> 59:56.020
like chemistry,

59:56.180 --> 59:56.560
geology,

59:57.000 --> 59:57.540
the biological,

59:57.760 --> 59:58.180
the mental,

59:58.320 --> 59:58.920
and the cultural,

59:59.480 --> 01:00:00.140
each representing

01:00:00.140 --> 01:00:01.380
a domain of increasing

01:00:01.380 --> 01:00:02.300
emergent complexity.

01:00:03.420 --> 01:00:04.560
RSVP offers a way

01:00:04.560 --> 01:00:05.140
to mathematically

01:00:05.140 --> 01:00:06.300
formalize these orders.

01:00:06.840 --> 01:00:07.480
Each could correspond

01:00:07.480 --> 01:00:08.820
to a specific threshold

01:00:08.820 --> 01:00:10.240
of entropy regulation,

01:00:10.780 --> 01:00:11.380
analogous to

01:00:11.380 --> 01:00:12.060
phase transitions

01:00:12.060 --> 01:00:12.640
in physics,

01:00:13.000 --> 01:00:13.800
where new kinds

01:00:13.800 --> 01:00:14.820
of stable attractors,

01:00:15.060 --> 01:00:16.220
new levels of organization,

01:00:16.660 --> 01:00:17.280
emerge governed

01:00:17.280 --> 01:00:18.600
by specific configurations

01:00:18.600 --> 01:00:19.280
and couplings

01:00:19.280 --> 01:00:20.120
of the underlying

01:00:20.120 --> 01:00:21.580
FE and S fields.

01:00:21.940 --> 01:00:22.700
These aren't just

01:00:22.700 --> 01:00:23.620
qualitative descriptions

01:00:23.620 --> 01:00:23.940
anymore,

01:00:24.140 --> 01:00:25.220
but potentially distinct

01:00:25.220 --> 01:00:26.440
mathematical regimes

01:00:26.440 --> 01:00:27.880
explaining how genuinely

01:00:27.880 --> 01:00:28.640
new properties

01:00:28.640 --> 01:00:29.320
and capacities

01:00:29.320 --> 01:00:29.920
can arise

01:00:29.920 --> 01:00:30.700
at higher levels

01:00:30.700 --> 01:00:31.280
of complexity.

01:00:31.980 --> 01:00:32.560
And this gives us

01:00:32.560 --> 01:00:33.600
a totally new perspective

01:00:33.600 --> 01:00:35.140
on how science itself works,

01:00:35.220 --> 01:00:36.360
on what scientific laws

01:00:36.360 --> 01:00:36.860
even are,

01:00:37.200 --> 01:00:37.740
going beyond

01:00:37.740 --> 01:00:38.660
just simple rules.

01:00:38.860 --> 01:00:39.100
Yes,

01:00:39.180 --> 01:00:40.380
it profoundly reframes

01:00:40.380 --> 01:00:40.660
that.

01:00:41.420 --> 01:00:42.660
Laws in this view

01:00:42.660 --> 01:00:43.700
aren't these timeless,

01:00:44.020 --> 01:00:45.000
absolute dictates

01:00:45.000 --> 01:00:46.060
handed down from nowhere.

01:00:46.580 --> 01:00:47.520
They exist on a spectrum.

01:00:47.980 --> 01:00:48.460
At one end,

01:00:48.540 --> 01:00:49.540
you have low-cost,

01:00:49.640 --> 01:00:50.580
high-error heuristics,

01:00:50.940 --> 01:00:52.180
our everyday rules of thumb,

01:00:52.240 --> 01:00:53.400
useful approximations.

01:00:53.800 --> 01:00:54.900
Then you have rules,

01:00:55.300 --> 01:00:56.040
patterns that hold

01:00:56.040 --> 01:00:56.620
more reliably.

01:00:57.040 --> 01:00:57.840
And at the far end,

01:00:57.960 --> 01:00:58.780
you have the high-fidelity

01:00:58.780 --> 01:01:00.180
probabilistic attractors

01:01:00.180 --> 01:01:00.860
that we call

01:01:00.860 --> 01:01:01.720
scientific laws.

01:01:02.400 --> 01:01:03.280
In RSVP,

01:01:03.400 --> 01:01:04.080
laws are essentially

01:01:04.080 --> 01:01:04.920
entropy-averaged

01:01:04.920 --> 01:01:05.540
invariances.

01:01:06.000 --> 01:01:07.220
They reflect the time-average

01:01:07.220 --> 01:01:08.120
stability of the

01:01:08.120 --> 01:01:09.300
scalar-vector-enter-B

01:01:09.300 --> 01:01:10.220
couplings within

01:01:10.220 --> 01:01:11.240
a particular regime

01:01:11.240 --> 01:01:12.140
or natural order.

01:01:12.600 --> 01:01:13.520
They are, in a sense,

01:01:13.640 --> 01:01:14.740
extremely high-fidelity

01:01:14.740 --> 01:01:15.360
heuristics,

01:01:15.880 --> 01:01:16.900
valid within a certain

01:01:16.900 --> 01:01:18.020
probabilistic horizon.

01:01:18.620 --> 01:01:19.960
This beautifully embodies

01:01:19.960 --> 01:01:20.860
Charles Pierce's

01:01:20.860 --> 01:01:22.000
philosophical concept

01:01:22.000 --> 01:01:22.780
of fallibilism,

01:01:23.040 --> 01:01:23.840
the idea that

01:01:23.840 --> 01:01:24.660
all our knowledge,

01:01:24.820 --> 01:01:25.540
even our best

01:01:25.540 --> 01:01:26.300
scientific laws,

01:01:26.600 --> 01:01:27.140
is ultimately

01:01:27.140 --> 01:01:27.880
provisional,

01:01:28.180 --> 01:01:28.580
approximate,

01:01:28.780 --> 01:01:29.540
and open to future

01:01:29.540 --> 01:01:30.660
revision as our

01:01:30.660 --> 01:01:31.520
understanding of the

01:01:31.520 --> 01:01:32.220
underlying field

01:01:32.220 --> 01:01:33.200
dynamics deepens.

01:01:33.260 --> 01:01:33.960
And it even tackles

01:01:33.960 --> 01:01:34.640
things like purpose

01:01:34.640 --> 01:01:35.440
and causality.

01:01:35.440 --> 01:01:36.500
It attempts to.

01:01:37.300 --> 01:01:38.420
RSVP models

01:01:38.420 --> 01:01:39.000
teleonomy,

01:01:39.420 --> 01:01:40.540
which is purpose-like

01:01:40.540 --> 01:01:41.820
organization or behavior

01:01:41.820 --> 01:01:42.980
without assuming

01:01:42.980 --> 01:01:43.880
foresight or

01:01:43.880 --> 01:01:45.020
supernatural design,

01:01:45.380 --> 01:01:46.520
by seeing it as the

01:01:46.520 --> 01:01:47.440
natural outcome of

01:01:47.440 --> 01:01:48.440
systems settling

01:01:48.440 --> 01:01:49.420
into homeostatic

01:01:49.420 --> 01:01:50.000
attractors,

01:01:50.300 --> 01:01:51.780
or following entropy-

01:01:51.780 --> 01:01:52.860
minimizing trajectories

01:01:52.860 --> 01:01:54.160
through the state space.

01:01:55.360 --> 01:01:56.040
Think of a river

01:01:56.040 --> 01:01:57.000
naturally finding the

01:01:57.000 --> 01:01:58.120
path of least resistance

01:01:58.120 --> 01:01:58.900
down to the sea.

01:01:59.360 --> 01:02:00.360
It looks purposeful,

01:02:00.640 --> 01:02:01.420
but it's just physics.

01:02:01.420 --> 01:02:02.660
This provides a

01:02:02.660 --> 01:02:03.440
potential mathematical

01:02:03.440 --> 01:02:04.400
basis for understanding

01:02:04.400 --> 01:02:06.000
final causes in the

01:02:06.000 --> 01:02:07.100
Aristotelian sense of

01:02:07.100 --> 01:02:08.160
what something is for,

01:02:08.640 --> 01:02:09.260
stripped of any

01:02:09.260 --> 01:02:09.920
mystical baggage.

01:02:10.580 --> 01:02:11.380
Furthermore, it

01:02:11.380 --> 01:02:12.520
rigorously formalizes

01:02:12.520 --> 01:02:13.740
downward causation.

01:02:13.840 --> 01:02:15.000
Downward causation,

01:02:15.140 --> 01:02:15.780
where the whole

01:02:15.780 --> 01:02:16.940
influences the parts.

01:02:17.020 --> 01:02:17.300
Exactly.

01:02:17.540 --> 01:02:18.260
Where system-level

01:02:18.260 --> 01:02:19.340
properties, emergent

01:02:19.340 --> 01:02:20.320
patterns, feedback,

01:02:20.700 --> 01:02:21.880
and genuinely constrain

01:02:21.880 --> 01:02:22.640
or influence the

01:02:22.640 --> 01:02:23.460
behavior of the

01:02:23.460 --> 01:02:24.340
lower-level components.

01:02:25.140 --> 01:02:26.160
RSVP models this

01:02:26.160 --> 01:02:26.960
through the non-linear

01:02:26.960 --> 01:02:27.920
couplings between the

01:02:27.920 --> 01:02:29.000
fields, showing how

01:02:29.000 --> 01:02:29.760
emergent properties

01:02:29.760 --> 01:02:30.540
aren't just passive

01:02:30.540 --> 01:02:31.520
side effects of a

01:02:31.520 --> 01:02:32.580
phenomena, but can

01:02:32.580 --> 01:02:33.400
exert real causal

01:02:33.400 --> 01:02:34.180
power back down

01:02:34.180 --> 01:02:34.480
onto their

01:02:34.480 --> 01:02:34.940
constituents.

01:02:35.320 --> 01:02:36.000
It's just amazing.

01:02:36.440 --> 01:02:37.580
And your sources even

01:02:37.580 --> 01:02:38.420
wrap up with this

01:02:38.420 --> 01:02:39.940
fascinating allegory from

01:02:39.940 --> 01:02:40.360
the Renaissance

01:02:40.360 --> 01:02:41.960
philosopher Giordano

01:02:41.960 --> 01:02:42.260
Bruno.

01:02:42.460 --> 01:02:43.380
Something about Noah's

01:02:43.380 --> 01:02:44.360
Ark that ties some of

01:02:44.360 --> 01:02:45.220
these threads together.

01:02:45.720 --> 01:02:46.800
Power, perception,

01:02:47.520 --> 01:02:48.160
hidden meanings.

01:02:48.600 --> 01:02:49.060
Ah, yes.

01:02:49.220 --> 01:02:50.200
Bruno's brilliant little

01:02:50.200 --> 01:02:51.140
fable of the Ark of

01:02:51.140 --> 01:02:51.340
Noah.

01:02:52.220 --> 01:02:53.360
In it, the donkeys,

01:02:53.940 --> 01:02:54.840
burdened with labor,

01:02:55.240 --> 01:02:56.360
complain bitterly about

01:02:56.360 --> 01:02:57.320
their lowly status.

01:02:58.120 --> 01:02:59.140
Meanwhile, the foxes,

01:02:59.140 --> 01:02:59.940
who are clever and

01:02:59.940 --> 01:03:00.720
hold positions of

01:03:00.720 --> 01:03:01.980
influence, eloquently

01:03:01.980 --> 01:03:03.080
justify the existing

01:03:03.080 --> 01:03:04.960
hierarchy as natural,

01:03:05.220 --> 01:03:06.420
inevitable, the best

01:03:06.420 --> 01:03:07.120
possible order.

01:03:07.620 --> 01:03:08.200
Bruno, of course,

01:03:08.280 --> 01:03:08.980
lived in a time of

01:03:08.980 --> 01:03:10.000
intense censorship and

01:03:10.000 --> 01:03:10.880
was eventually burned at

01:03:10.880 --> 01:03:11.540
the stake for his

01:03:11.540 --> 01:03:12.840
radical ideas, so he

01:03:12.840 --> 01:03:13.680
became a master of

01:03:13.680 --> 01:03:15.100
allegory, of saying one

01:03:15.100 --> 01:03:15.720
thing while meaning

01:03:15.720 --> 01:03:16.080
another.

01:03:16.480 --> 01:03:17.000
So what's the hitter

01:03:17.000 --> 01:03:17.540
meaning here?

01:03:17.640 --> 01:03:18.040
You mentioned

01:03:18.040 --> 01:03:18.980
protective camouflage

01:03:18.980 --> 01:03:19.900
and double address.

01:03:20.180 --> 01:03:21.020
How does that relate to

01:03:21.020 --> 01:03:22.000
incompleteness or

01:03:22.000 --> 01:03:22.780
suppressed ideas?

01:03:23.300 --> 01:03:24.140
To a literal-minded

01:03:24.140 --> 01:03:25.300
censor, or to someone

01:03:25.300 --> 01:03:26.180
benefiting from the

01:03:26.180 --> 01:03:26.980
status quo, like

01:03:26.980 --> 01:03:28.520
Bruno's foxes, the

01:03:28.520 --> 01:03:29.480
fable reads simply as

01:03:29.480 --> 01:03:30.420
a conservative warning.

01:03:31.080 --> 01:03:32.280
Don't rebel, accept

01:03:32.280 --> 01:03:33.060
the natural order,

01:03:33.380 --> 01:03:34.120
because attempts to

01:03:34.120 --> 01:03:34.800
change it will only

01:03:34.800 --> 01:03:35.880
lead to chaos, like

01:03:35.880 --> 01:03:36.260
the flood.

01:03:37.020 --> 01:03:37.980
The foxes' arguments

01:03:37.980 --> 01:03:38.940
provide the detective

01:03:38.940 --> 01:03:39.620
camouflage.

01:03:40.600 --> 01:03:42.160
But, to a perceptive

01:03:42.160 --> 01:03:42.720
reader somewhat

01:03:42.720 --> 01:03:44.060
attuned to meta-levels,

01:03:44.100 --> 01:03:44.860
like us discussing

01:03:44.860 --> 01:03:46.100
Godel, the fable

01:03:46.100 --> 01:03:47.160
carries a double

01:03:47.160 --> 01:03:47.620
address.

01:03:48.440 --> 01:03:49.580
It subtly hints that

01:03:49.580 --> 01:03:50.720
rebellion is imaginable,

01:03:51.060 --> 01:03:51.780
that the current order

01:03:51.780 --> 01:03:52.360
isn't the only

01:03:52.360 --> 01:03:53.480
possibility, and

01:03:53.480 --> 01:03:54.320
indeed that the system

01:03:54.320 --> 01:03:55.820
itself, represented by

01:03:55.820 --> 01:03:56.840
the foxes, fears this

01:03:56.840 --> 01:03:57.540
possibility being

01:03:57.540 --> 01:03:58.040
recognized.

01:03:58.600 --> 01:03:59.200
The donkey's

01:03:59.200 --> 01:04:00.200
complaints represent the

01:04:00.200 --> 01:04:01.660
externalized cost, the

01:04:01.660 --> 01:04:02.820
suppressed truth, the

01:04:02.820 --> 01:04:03.900
inherent incompleteness of

01:04:03.900 --> 01:04:04.700
the foxes' perfect

01:04:04.700 --> 01:04:05.060
system.

01:04:05.460 --> 01:04:06.640
It's a masterful, subtle

01:04:06.640 --> 01:04:07.620
way to discuss power

01:04:07.620 --> 01:04:08.700
dynamics, the hidden

01:04:08.700 --> 01:04:09.640
labor and suffering that

01:04:09.640 --> 01:04:10.680
often sustains seemingly

01:04:10.680 --> 01:04:12.500
stable social orders, and

01:04:12.500 --> 01:04:13.640
the persistent existence of

01:04:13.640 --> 01:04:14.520
suppressed ideas and

01:04:14.520 --> 01:04:15.540
alternative possibilities

01:04:15.540 --> 01:04:16.440
simmering beneath the

01:04:16.440 --> 01:04:17.420
surface of any

01:04:17.420 --> 01:04:18.580
established, seemingly

01:04:18.580 --> 01:04:19.420
closed system.

01:04:19.420 --> 01:04:20.440
It's a powerful

01:04:20.440 --> 01:04:21.540
metaphor for how those

01:04:21.540 --> 01:04:22.780
null signals, those

01:04:22.780 --> 01:04:24.240
unacknowledged costs or

01:04:24.240 --> 01:04:25.500
incompletenesses, are

01:04:25.500 --> 01:04:26.600
managed or dangerously

01:04:26.600 --> 01:04:27.580
ignored within human

01:04:27.580 --> 01:04:28.780
systems, just as much as

01:04:28.780 --> 01:04:29.900
in circuits or cosmology.

01:04:30.440 --> 01:04:31.300
Hashtag tag outro.

01:04:32.140 --> 01:04:33.960
So, we've taken quite a

01:04:33.960 --> 01:04:34.520
journey today.

01:04:35.080 --> 01:04:36.380
From the deep, abstract

01:04:36.380 --> 01:04:37.740
logic of Godel, through

01:04:37.740 --> 01:04:38.600
the nuts and bolts of

01:04:38.600 --> 01:04:39.820
computer chips with NCL,

01:04:40.180 --> 01:04:41.360
across the thermodynamics

01:04:41.360 --> 01:04:42.740
of Prigagene, into the

01:04:42.740 --> 01:04:44.080
historical contingencies of

01:04:44.080 --> 01:04:45.280
encoding ratchets, and

01:04:45.280 --> 01:04:46.140
finally reaching the

01:04:46.140 --> 01:04:47.380
vastness of the cosmos with

01:04:47.380 --> 01:04:48.580
RSVP and its

01:04:48.580 --> 01:04:49.680
implications for cognition

01:04:49.680 --> 01:04:50.220
and AI.

01:04:50.920 --> 01:04:51.760
The really profound

01:04:51.760 --> 01:04:52.640
realization, weaving

01:04:52.640 --> 01:04:53.420
through all your sources,

01:04:53.820 --> 01:04:54.780
is that incompleteness

01:04:54.780 --> 01:04:55.980
isn't some defect we need

01:04:55.980 --> 01:04:56.720
to engineer away.

01:04:57.380 --> 01:04:58.580
It's a fundamental, even

01:04:58.580 --> 01:04:59.580
elegant, architectural

01:04:59.580 --> 01:05:00.040
principle.

01:05:00.340 --> 01:05:01.240
It's what ensures the

01:05:01.240 --> 01:05:02.580
coherence, the stability,

01:05:02.700 --> 01:05:03.460
the very function of

01:05:03.460 --> 01:05:04.660
systems at absolutely

01:05:04.660 --> 01:05:05.380
every scale.

01:05:05.580 --> 01:05:06.280
Yeah, and those

01:05:06.280 --> 01:05:07.020
constraints from the

01:05:07.020 --> 01:05:07.640
cosmic microwave

01:05:07.640 --> 01:05:08.460
background, especially

01:05:08.460 --> 01:05:09.480
when seen through this

01:05:09.480 --> 01:05:11.500
RSVP lens, they paid a

01:05:11.500 --> 01:05:12.520
picture of our universe

01:05:12.520 --> 01:05:13.980
that's maybe less like

01:05:13.980 --> 01:05:16.340
one lucky ticket from a

01:05:16.340 --> 01:05:17.500
chaotic multiverse

01:05:17.500 --> 01:05:17.900
lottery.

01:05:17.900 --> 01:05:19.380
And more like a

01:05:19.380 --> 01:05:20.720
globally self-constrained,

01:05:20.860 --> 01:05:22.220
deeply coherent plenum,

01:05:22.480 --> 01:05:23.680
this vast encropic field

01:05:23.680 --> 01:05:25.180
where voids actively fall

01:05:25.180 --> 01:05:25.960
outward and matter

01:05:25.960 --> 01:05:27.020
naturally pulls inward,

01:05:27.320 --> 01:05:28.460
all driven by the same

01:05:28.460 --> 01:05:29.400
underlying dynamics,

01:05:29.720 --> 01:05:30.760
maintaining an astonishing

01:05:30.760 --> 01:05:32.300
coherence far beyond what we

01:05:32.300 --> 01:05:33.400
can even directly observe.

01:05:33.900 --> 01:05:34.560
It's like the universe

01:05:34.560 --> 01:05:36.520
itself is managing its own

01:05:36.520 --> 01:05:37.480
incompleteness on the

01:05:37.480 --> 01:05:38.140
grandest scale.

01:05:38.360 --> 01:05:39.540
So the final thought, the

01:05:39.540 --> 01:05:40.580
provocative question for you

01:05:40.580 --> 01:05:41.300
listening is this.

01:05:41.940 --> 01:05:43.720
If the universe itself, if our

01:05:43.720 --> 01:05:44.960
most advanced computation,

01:05:44.960 --> 01:05:47.060
if even our own minds are

01:05:47.060 --> 01:05:48.280
fundamentally structured by

01:05:48.280 --> 01:05:49.380
incompleteness, by the

01:05:49.380 --> 01:05:50.460
essential need to manage

01:05:50.460 --> 01:05:52.500
boundaries, to signal null

01:05:52.500 --> 01:05:54.420
states, to externalize or

01:05:54.420 --> 01:05:56.620
internalize costs, how might

01:05:56.620 --> 01:05:58.800
consciously recognizing these

01:05:58.800 --> 01:05:59.820
null signals, these

01:05:59.820 --> 01:06:00.680
architectural boundaries,

01:06:01.180 --> 01:06:02.440
transform the way you

01:06:02.440 --> 01:06:03.160
approach things?

01:06:03.700 --> 01:06:04.960
How might it change how you

01:06:04.960 --> 01:06:05.940
build systems, how you

01:06:05.940 --> 01:06:07.220
understand human behavior,

01:06:07.480 --> 01:06:08.780
how you interpret scientific

01:06:08.780 --> 01:06:10.040
discoveries, or even how you

01:06:10.040 --> 01:06:11.260
perceive your own place

01:06:11.260 --> 01:06:12.760
within this profoundly

01:06:12.760 --> 01:06:14.200
interconnected, perpetually

01:06:14.200 --> 01:06:15.960
incomplete, yet dynamically

01:06:15.960 --> 01:06:17.400
self-regulating reality?

01:06:17.660 --> 01:06:18.580
It really does give us a

01:06:18.580 --> 01:06:19.860
completely new way to see

01:06:19.860 --> 01:06:20.740
the world, doesn't it?

01:06:20.760 --> 01:06:22.580
Not as just a collection of

01:06:22.580 --> 01:06:24.340
isolated, finished parts that

01:06:24.340 --> 01:06:25.620
are somehow magically complete

01:06:25.620 --> 01:06:26.880
on their own, but as this

01:06:26.880 --> 01:06:28.340
grand, dynamic, evolving,

01:06:28.580 --> 01:06:29.720
incomplete, yet somehow

01:06:29.720 --> 01:06:31.500
utterly coherent whole,

01:06:32.180 --> 01:06:33.480
always communicating its

01:06:33.480 --> 01:06:34.660
state, always managing its

01:06:34.660 --> 01:06:34.980
boundaries.

01:06:35.100 --> 01:06:36.060
It's really an invitation,

01:06:36.240 --> 01:06:37.420
isn't it, to look for those

01:06:37.420 --> 01:06:38.620
invisible architectures, those

01:06:38.620 --> 01:06:39.460
hidden signals, those

01:06:39.460 --> 01:06:41.020
suppressed alternatives that are

01:06:41.020 --> 01:06:42.360
shaping everything around us

01:06:42.360 --> 01:06:42.980
all the time.

